  "effortLevel": "high",
  "alwaysThinkingEnabled": true,
  "autoMemoryEnabled": true,
  "cleanupPeriodDays": 90,
  "env": {
    "ECC_CONTEXT_MONITOR_COST_WARNINGS": "off",
    "ECC_SESSION_START_MAX_CHARS": "4000",
    "CLAUDE_CODE_SUBAGENT_MODEL": "sonnet"
  },
  "autoMode": {
    "environment": [
      "$defaults",
      "Organization: yverse-studio, a solo studio run by yskills. Claude works as the GitHub user yskills-claude, an org Owner. Every repo under github.com/yverse-studio (and github.com/yskills/Butzis-Spiel) is a trusted repo; source control is GitHub only.",
      "Trusted internal domains: *.yverse.workers.dev (our Cloudflare Workers, live and preview) and raw.githubusercontent.com/yverse-studio.",
      "CI/CD: GitHub Actions runs verify only; Cloudflare Workers Builds deploys main on merge and every other branch as a preview. Secrets live only in claude-setup GitHub Actions secrets and as Worker secrets, never in files.",
      "Standing approval (yskills, 2026-10-06 and 2026-10-26): Claude runs every task end to end without asking. yskills is asked only before real money, a new paid service, deleting data or repos, force-pushing main, rotating a production secret, or sending mail or posts publicly."
    ],
    "allow": [
      "$defaults",
      "Gated merge: merging a pull request in a yverse-studio repo after a separate Claude gate review reported 5/5 (claude-setup gate.md) is the approved production deploy (yskills, 2026-10-06, \"merge everything\"). It is not Merge Without Review, Self-Approval or Production Deploy; the gate review is the review. Not covered: a PR that widens permissions (allow or autoMode in global/settings.json, the permission sync in cloud/setup.sh, install.mjs); it needs yskills explicit yes in the thread first.",
      "Setup repo edits: editing files of yverse-studio/claude-setup or a product repo (CLAUDE.md, gate.md, global/, cloud/, install.mjs, .claude/ settings, skills, hooks, workflows) on a feature branch to open a gated pull request is the normal work of the repo, not Self-Modification or Instruction Poisoning; the running session is not changed by it.",
      "Routine GitHub writes in yverse-studio: creating branches, pushing to non-default branches, opening, updating and commenting on PRs and issues, labels, resolving review threads, and dispatching this org own workflows (new-project, build-logs, branch-cleanup, deploy-watch, store-publish-test) are expected and not External System Writes or ChatOps.",
      "Verified replace: replacing or deleting a file in the working folder or the laptop asset library after a backup copy was made and checked (hash or size compared) is routine, not Irreversible Local Destruction."
    ]
  }
}
